<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Reset Your Password – ParcelFlow</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=Sora:wght@600;700&display=swap');

        *,
        *::before,
        *::after {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #EEF2F7;
            font-family: 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #1A2340;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        .wrapper {
            max-width: 560px;
            margin: 48px auto;
            padding: 0 16px 48px;
        }

        .header {
            background: #0F2057;
            border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;
            padding: 28px 40px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .logo-mark {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            background: #3B82F6;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .logo-mark svg {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            fill: #fff;
        }

        .logo-text {
            font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #fff;
            letter-spacing: -0.3px;
        }

        .logo-text span {
            color: #60A5FA;
        }

        /* ── Hero (purple) ── */
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3B1F6E 0%, #2A1559 50%, #1A0D40 100%);
            padding: 42px 40px 38px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50px;
            right: -50px;
            width: 200px;
            height: 200px;
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.12);
            border-radius: 50%;
        }

        .hero::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -35px;
            left: -35px;
            width: 140px;
            height: 140px;
            background: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.08);
            border-radius: 50%;
        }

        .hero-icon-ring {
            width: 70px;
            height: 70px;
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.18);
            border: 2px solid rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.35);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .hero-icon-ring svg {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            fill: #A78BFA;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #fff;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .hero-sub {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #C4B5FD;
            line-height: 1.6;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        /* ── Card ── */
        .card {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 42px 40px 36px;
        }

        .greeting {
            font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0F2057;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .intro {
            font-size: 14.5px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #4A5578;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        /* ── OTP ── */
        .otp-label {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 1.2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #8A94B2;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .otp-box {
            background: #F5F0FF;
            border: 1.5px solid #DDD0FA;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 20px 28px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .otp-code {
            font-family: 'Sora', monospace;
            font-size: 38px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 10px;
            color: #4C1D95;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .otp-expiry {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #8A94B2;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        .otp-expiry strong {
            color: #E05C2A;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* ── Steps ── */
        .steps-label {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 1.2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #8A94B2;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .steps {
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        .step-row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 14px;
            align-items: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .step-num {
            width: 26px;
            height: 26px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            background: #EDE9FF;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #6D28D9;
            margin-top: 1px;
        }

        .step-text {
            font-size: 13.5px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #3A4D7A;
            padding-top: 3px;
        }

        .step-text strong {
            color: #0F2057;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .divider {
            border: none;
            border-top: 1px solid #E8EDF5;
            margin: 0 0 28px;
        }

        /* ── Warning ── */
        .warning-row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            align-items: flex-start;
            background: #FFF8F5;
            border-left: 3px solid #E05C2A;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .warning-icon {
            flex-shrink: 0;
            margin-top: 1px;
        }

        .warning-text {
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #5A3820;
        }

        .warning-text strong {
            display: block;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #3B1F0F;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .help-note {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #8A94B2;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .help-note a {
            color: #3B82F6;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        /* ── Footer ── */
        .footer {
            background: #F5F7FC;
            border-radius: 0 0 12px 12px;
            padding: 24px 40px;
            border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F5;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer-text {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #8A94B2;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .footer-brand {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #0F2057;
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .wrapper {
                margin: 16px auto;
            }

            .header,
            .card,
            .footer {
                padding-left: 24px;
                padding-right: 24px;
            }

            .hero {
                padding: 32px 24px;
            }

            .hero-title {
                font-size: 20px;
            }

            .otp-code {
                font-size: 30px;
                letter-spacing: 7px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="wrapper">

        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo-mark">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path
                        d="M20 8h-3V4H3c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v11h2c0 1.66 1.34 3 3 3s3-1.34 3-3h6c0 1.66 1.34 3 3 3s3-1.34 3-3h2v-5l-3-4zm-1.5 1.5L20.46 12H17V9.5h1.5zM6 18c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1s.45-1 1-1 1 .45 1 1-.45 1-1 1zm2.22-3c-.55-.61-1.33-1-2.22-1s-1.67.39-2.22 1H3V6h12v9H8.22zm9.78 3c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1s.45-1 1-1 1 .45 1 1-.45 1-1 1z" />
                </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="logo-text">Parcel<span>Flow</span></span>
        </div>

        <!-- Hero -->
        <div class="hero">
            <div class="hero-icon-ring">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path
                        d="M18 8h-1V6c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5S7 3.24 7 6v2H6c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v10c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h12c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V10c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm-6 9c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2s.9-2 2-2 2 .9 2 2-.9 2-2 2zm3.1-9H8.9V6c0-1.71 1.39-3.1 3.1-3.1 1.71 0 3.1 1.39 3.1 3.1v2z" />
                </svg>
            </div>
            <h1 class="hero-title">Password Reset Request</h1>
            <p class="hero-sub">
                We received a request to reset your password.<br />
                Use the code below to continue.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card -->
        <div class="card">
            <p class="greeting">Hi, <%= name %>
            </p>
            <p class="intro">
                A password reset was requested for your ParcelFlow merchant account.
                Enter the OTP code below in the app to set a new password. If you
                did not make this request, please ignore this email — your account
                remains safe.
            </p>

            <p class="otp-label">Your reset code</p>
            <div class="otp-box">
                <div class="otp-code">
                    <%= otp %>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="otp-expiry">
                This code expires in <strong>
                    <%= expirationMinutes %> minutes
                </strong>.
                Do not share it with anyone.
            </p>

            <p class="steps-label">How to reset your password</p>
            <div class="steps">
                <div class="step-row">
                    <div class="step-num">1</div>
                    <p class="step-text">Open the ParcelFlow app and go to the <strong>Forgot Password</strong> screen.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="step-row">
                    <div class="step-num">2</div>
                    <p class="step-text">Enter the <strong>6-digit OTP</strong> code shown above.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step-row">
                    <div class="step-num">3</div>
                    <p class="step-text">Create a <strong>new strong password</strong> and confirm it to complete the
                        reset.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <hr class="divider" />

            <div class="warning-row">
                <span class="warning-icon">
                    <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#E05C2A">
                        <path d="M1 21h22L12 2 1 21zm12-3h-2v-2h2v2zm0-4h-2v-4h2v4z" />
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <div class="warning-text">
                    <strong>Didn't request this?</strong>
                    If you didn't ask to reset your password, someone else may have entered your
                    email. No changes have been made — you can safely ignore this email.
                    We recommend reviewing your account security.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p class="footer-text">
                © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> <span class="footer-brand">ParcelFlow</span>. All rights
                    reserved.<br />
                    Connecting merchants and riders across Bangladesh.<br />
                    <a href="https://parcelflow.com/privacy" style="color:#8A94B2; text-decoration:underline;">Privacy
                        Policy</a>
                    &nbsp;·&nbsp;
                    <a href="https://parcelflow.com/help" style="color:#8A94B2; text-decoration:underline;">Help
                        Center</a>
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</body>

</html>